      "lineage": {
        "description": "WFP ADAM collected and mapped observed flood extent and socio-economic impact data following the 17 November 2023 flood event in Tanzania. Geospatial flood boundaries were delineated and overlaid with population and cropland datasets to quantify directly affected populations and agricultural losses. The resulting multi-format dataset (GeoJSON, GeoTIFF, GeoPackage) provides post-event impact assessment for humanitarian response.",
