            "used_in": "loss",
            "description": "WFP ADAM is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden-onset humanitarian emergencies. This dataset aggregates post-event flood extent mapping and affected population estimates from the November 2023 Tanzania flood event."
